  "description": "Typst PDF rendering for Elarion (ADR-0093): ITypstCompiler runs the pinned Typst CLI in a fresh, sandboxed workspace per document (data.json, assets, a generated main file), bounds concurrency and time, and returns the PDF as a self-deleting stream. Its MSBuild targets acquire the pinned, checksum-verified Typst binary at build time for every executable that references it, and copy the application's Typst package and font tree next to it.",
